=== PARITY (vs web UptimeMonitorWidget.tsx) ===
  Data sources → bound via the shared state-holder seam (UptimeMonitorSource → UptimeMonitorModel):
    useSystemHealth (useAdmin), useTranslation. The production app wires UptimeMonitorSource over the
